WEBVTT

00:06:59.989 --> 00:07:02.536
with wholly different meanings.

00:07:03.108 --> 00:07:04.673
As a Jewish person,

00:07:04.697 --> 00:07:07.491
I believe that this logo,

00:07:07.515 --> 00:07:09.565
this swastika,

00:07:09.589 --> 00:07:12.780
is the most heinous logo of all time.

00:07:13.448 --> 00:07:16.995
But it actually has
a rather surprising trajectory.

00:07:17.453 --> 00:07:21.156
The word "swastika" originally comes from

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:25.187
the ancient Sanskrit word "svastika,"

00:07:25.211 --> 00:07:27.636
which actually means "good fortune,"

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:30.045
"luck" and "well-being."